Package: BiocManager
Title: Access the Bioconductor Project Package Repository
Description: The Bioconductor project publishes packages on a six-month release
    cycle. This package is a convenient tool to install and update Bioconductor
    packages. For more information about Bioconductor, see
    <https://bioconductor.org>.
